window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Maybe Autumn Owens shouldn’t have based the love interest in her novel on her ex-boyfriend’s older brother.</p> <p></p> <p>It’s possible that wasn’t her brightest idea.</p> <p></p> <p>After six years without seeing or hearing from Miles Cress, he’s suddenly back. He still lives in town, he’s still the kind, caring guy he used to be.</p> <p></p> <p>And he’s not going anywhere.</p> <p></p> <p>He doesn’t want to be anywhere too far from her at all, actually, but their pasts are eager to keep them apart, while they find themselves desperate to get closer.</p> <p></p> <p>He’s always been the helping hand she needed, but what is he supposed to do when the problem is the people he’s closest to?</p>"; 
